{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026REj9LwBQTY1795584779.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普為慶祝感恩節，按傳統特赦兩隻火雞，他又提到伊朗局勢。</p><p></p><p>美國總統特朗普說︰「『自由』我想你知道，你和『羽毛』此刻獲特赦了。」</p><p></p><p>特朗普和夫人梅拉尼亞周二在白宮特赦兩隻火雞，牠們有四個月大、名為「自由」及「羽毛」，其名字由網民投票選出，今後會在得州農場繼續生活 。</p><p></p><p>特朗普重申，要確保伊朗不能擁有核武，並感謝在霍爾木茲海峽的美軍人員。伊朗軍方表明，在德黑蘭政府提出七項條件，獲美方落實之前，伊方會繼續封鎖海峽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:23:55.760359+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T01:52:05.797762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T08:17:18.069784+00:00","content_hash":"f181ae946c939206e43465e9ec372f7ade4a4dde4242afbeab83b7f81ed2d16a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:23:55.760359+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}